# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Meridiano — meridianocasa.com
# Copy to `.env.local` for local dev, and set these in the host for prod.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Public site URL — drives canonical, sitemap, hreflang and Open Graph.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://meridianocasa.com

# Where contact-form messages are delivered. A Zapier / Make / Google Apps
# Script endpoint that forwards to hello@meridianocasa.com.
# Leave blank in dev: messages are logged to the server console instead.
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXX/exec

# No analytics keys by design. The handoff is explicit: no Google Analytics,
# no Meta Pixel, no third-party trackers at launch. When traffic data is
# needed, add self-hosted Plausible or Umami — nothing else.
